direction: right
Creator: Content creator {shape: person}
Upload: Upload API {shape: rectangle}
Raw: Raw video storage {shape: stored_data}
Jobs: Transcode jobs {shape: queue}
Transcoder: Transcode workers {shape: rectangle}
Packager: HLS packager {shape: rectangle}
Origin: Media origin {shape: stored_data}
CDN: Global CDN {shape: cloud}
Viewer: Video player {shape: page}
Creator -> Upload
Upload -> Raw
Upload -> Jobs
Jobs -> Transcoder
Transcoder -> Raw: read source
Transcoder -> Packager
Packager -> Origin
Origin -> CDN
CDN -> Viewer
